OL,3,GNEWSAPost-mortem exam finds woman died 
OL,4,Afrom stab wound                        
OL,6,FA woman who was found dead in Wisbech  
OL,7,Fdied from a single stab wound, a       
OL,8,Fpost-mortem examination has concluded. 
OL,10,FThe body of Vera Jaunzeme, 61, was     
OL,11,Fdiscovered at a property in Alexandra  
OL,12,FRoad at about 21:50 GMT last Saturday. 
OL,14,FA 62-year-old man was arrested on      
OL,15,Fsuspicion of murder and taken to       
OL,16,Fhospital, where he remains.            
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Police said he would be 
OL,19,Ftaken into custody when he was         
OL,20,Fdischarged from hospital.              
